                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "And this is why I\u2019m angry that the Senate acted out of fear. Instead of daring the Democrats to raise a point of order thereby SUPPORTING taxpayer funding of transgender therapies, Senate Republicans caved. Now deranged \u201cdoctors\u201d across the country can continue billing Medicaid for experimental disfiguration of minors. \n\nAnd let me show you exactly why this is such a big problem. I acquired this test question from UCLA Medical School and personally verified it. Read it. It will shock you. Debunked pseudo science is being taught at top medical schools.\n\nThe Senate Parliamentarian is a partisan hack. My amendment was well within the Byrd rules of reconciliation. And Senators chose the easy path instead of fighting it. Disgraceful.",
