                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For years, I\u2019ve fought to stop your tax dollars from funding sex changes for children. \n\nNow, @POTUS is making it happen. No more Medicaid-funded puberty blockers. No more taxpayer-subsidized surgeries on minors.\n\nThis is a win for sanity. And for every parent who\u2019s had enough.",
