                "text": "So no. 51,000 people are not going to die because we\u2019ve strengthened and protected Medicaid for those who *truly* need it. \n\nBernie tried pushing this exact same bogus stat 3 months ago and I thoroughly debunked it. \n\nHere\u2019s that thread:\nhttps://t.co/1tqTHZdqZ2",
