                "text": "In the midst of hurricane season the Democrats are voting to SHUT DOWN the federal flood insurance program. The renewal of the Federal Flood Insurance program was in the CR. We made sure it was because we know how important it is.\n\nDemocrats are acting recklessly. And for what?",
