                "text": "Let me fix it for you Bernie:\n\nDemocrats are shutting it down, voting against a CLEAN temporary funding bill with zero strings attached, and you\u2019re whining about unrelated policy issues that, ironically, are characterized by government authoritarianism over healthcare. \n\nThere\u2019s no way way for Democrats to spin this one. Sorry.",
