                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last year, @RepGuthrie, @JayObernolte, @RepMMM, and I warned that the Biden HHS was handing the keys to healthcare AI over to Big Tech and hospital giants.\n\nThis course correction by President Trump\u2019s @HHSGov is exactly what we called for.\n\nThe Coalition for Health AI (CHAI) wanted to be judge, jury, and gatekeeper of ALL healthcare AI. And it was funded by the very same Big Tech companies making the tools.\n\nGlad to see the Trump administration shutting it down and restoring a level playing field.",
