                "reply_count": 23,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Statusbrew",
                "text": "Democrats are hurting people everyday. On purpose. With no remorse.\n\nThey claim it\u2019s for some noble cause. Bullshit. \n\nWhat they really want is to reopen the Medicaid loopholes that allow illegal immigrants to access Medicaid, and they want to spend almost $400B to prop up Obamacare subsidies that go straight to insurance companies and NOT you, the patient. \n\nAnd to justify it? They lie. They tell you your premiums will double if they don\u2019t get their way. That is total bullshit.\n\nThe truth is that the CBO has already scored this. The expiration of those subsidies accounts for just 8% of any premium increase.\n\nIs that worth debating? Yes, of course it is. The entire system is flawed because Democrats designed it to be flawed when they created Obamacare. We could start by talking about how subsidies should go to your personal Health Savings Account instead of insurance companies. \n\nBut let\u2019s be clear: there\u2019s no negotiating while the government is shut down. Period. You don\u2019t get to hold federal workers, military families, and vital services hostage just to push partisan policy demands.",
