                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Democrat strategy here is pure insanity, and people are finally starting to catch on. Democrats used to say it\u2019s wrong to hold paychecks and vital government services hostage. Yet they vote again and again to do exactly that.\n\nWhy? They claim it\u2019s about saving your healthcare but that\u2019s total BS. I\u2019ve debunked this multiple times. They\u2019re demanding an extension of temporary COVID subsidies that barely have an effect on anyone\u2019s ACA premiums. They chose an issue out of a hat just to show their base how much they\u2019re fighting the big mean orange man.",
