                "retweet_count": 74,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yes and yes. In fact I\u2019ve been working on this exact bill concept, where ACA subsidies would go to a tax-deductible Health Savings Account that YOU own. Why are Democrats so keen on subsidizing insurance companies instead of patients? Alll it has done is given insurance companies incentives to raise premiums (more subsidies) and get people signed up for junk insurance (more subsidies). Put the money in the patient\u2019s control, and you remove these market distortions and force insurance companies to compete for those dollars.",
