                "retweet_count": 27,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yeah you\u2019re still going with \u201cRepublican shutdown.\u201d Wow you must think people are stupid. \n\nNow healthcare. You created Obamacare without a single Republican vote, and created it to enrich insurance companies and screw up the individual market. Then you created more subsidies for insurance companies during COVID and *You set them to expire*. These subsidies barely account for 4% of any premium increases by the way. Premiums are going because of the crappy way *you designed Obamacare.\u201d\n\nSo spare us the faux moralizing.",
